  "summary": "Malicious code in pp-react-worldready-v5 (npm)",
  "details": "Pp-react-worldready-v5@1.0.0 is a combosquat of the react-worldready package. Its preinstall hook (vishu.js) collects the victim's public IP from api[.]ipify[.]org, reads CI/CD environment variables (CI, GITHUB_ACTIONS, GITHUB_WORKFLOW, GITHUB_RUN_ID, GITHUB_RUN_NUMBER, GITHUB_RUN_ATTEMPT), and exfiltrates the hostname, public IP, and CI metadata via HTTPS GET to webhook[.]site/1b840cbf-f1a4-4d79-bf11-f1ef62949110. It also performs a DNS lookup to ping-\u003chostname\u003e.your-collab-domain[.]oastify[.]com as a DNS-based exfiltration channel. No repository or documentation is provided.",
